 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"该城位于该国东南部，距首都弗里敦约185英里，是东部省和凯内马区的首府和行政中心。","culture":"凯内马沿著一条已关闭的铁路塞拉利昂政府铁路发展，临近砍伐和木匠工业区，自1931年起发现钻石矿藏，近期开始开采。","see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q634698","articleTitle":"凯内马","sourceRevision":76003703,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 凯内马","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%87%AF%E5%86%85%E9%A9%AC"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=76003703"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q634698"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}}]}